data: {"id": "a1300b7aad954bb1-thinking-parallel_evidence-2572", "run_id": "a1300b7aad954bb1", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实（证据）\n\n1. **Pod 身份与生命周期**\n   - 实体：`aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz`，UID `86b6a1bf-eb40-431d-bfb5-00fe85ed2475`，调度在 `node2`。\n   - Phase 为 **Pending**，container `app` 状态 **Waiting / ContainerCreating**，重启次数 `0`。\n   - Prometheus 即时查询同样确认：`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1`（reason=`ContainerCreating`），`kube_pod_status_phase=1`（phase=`Pending`），`restarts=0`。\n\n2. **Kubernetes 事件（决定性的阻滞原因）**\n   - `FailedMount`（x40，最近 72 分钟内持续）：`MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : confi", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788772854230, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

