event: node_complete
data: {"id": "a1300b7aad954bb1-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "a1300b7aad954bb1", "seq": 2575, "ts_ms": 1788772866344, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 7.551, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1481, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz` | ContainerCreating | Pod 定义中引用了不存在的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 作为卷 'input'，导致 kubelet 挂载卷持续失败，Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | `fact-bf96b814dba6` | `Warning FailedMount` ... MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found | 直接指出根因：ConfigMap 缺失导致挂载失败 |\n| 2 | K8s State | `fact-24b2559e994b` | `container.waiting_reason`: reason=\"ContainerCreating\" | 描述 Pod 因等待资源挂载而卡在启动阶段的状态 |\n| 3 | K8s State | `fact-45ae929b7899` | `pod.phase`: Pending | 宏观状态确认 Pod 无法进入运行阶段 |\n| 4 | Metric | `fact-233e939ea5ee` | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (reason=\"ContainerCreating\"): 1 | 验证了 K8s 观测到的 ContainerCreating 等待状态 |\n| 5 | Metric | `fact-dc5c3d5de12a` | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total`: 0 | 确认应用尚未启动，排除应用崩溃重启场景 |\n\n**证据总结**\nKubernetes Event（#1）明确记录了 `unavailable-config` ConfigMap 缺失导致卷挂载失败（`FailedMount`），这直接解释了 Pod 为何因资源无法就绪而处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态（#2, #3, #4），且由于容器从未启动，因此未发生任何重启（#5）。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 定义引用不存在的 ConfigMap (unavailable-config) → Kubelet 挂载卷 (input) 失败 → 容器启动阻塞 → Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因：Pod 的 YAML 定义中引用了一个不存在的 ConfigMap `unavailable-config` 作为卷 `input`。由于该配置项缺失，kubelet 在执行 `MountVolume.SetUp` 时失败，导致容器无法完成初始化挂载，从而使 Pod 持续处于 `ContainerCreating` 和 `Pending` 状态。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz` | ContainerCreating | Pod 定义中引用了不存在的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 作为卷 'input'，导致 kubelet 挂载卷持续失败，Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | `fact-bf96b814dba6` | `Warning FailedMount` ... MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found | 直接指出根因：ConfigMap 缺失导致挂载失败 |\n| 2 | K8s State | `fact-24b2559e994b` | `container.waiting_reason`: reason=\"ContainerCreating\" | 描述 Pod 因等待资源挂载而卡在启动阶段的状态 |\n| 3 | K8s State | `fact-45ae929b7899` | `pod.phase`: Pending | 宏观状态确认 Pod 无法进入运行阶段 |\n| 4 | Metric | `fact-233e939ea5ee` | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (reason=\"ContainerCreating\"): 1 | 验证了 K8s 观测到的 ContainerCreating 等待状态 |\n| 5 | Metric | `fact-dc5c3d5de12a` | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total`: 0 | 确认应用尚未启动，排除应用崩溃重启场景 |\n\n**证据总结**\nKubernetes Event（#1）明确记录了 `unavailable-config` ConfigMap 缺失导致卷挂载失败（`FailedMount`），这直接解释了 Pod 为何因资源无法就绪而处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态（#2, #3, #4），且由于容器从未启动，因此未发生任何重启（#5）。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 定义引用不存在的 ConfigMap (unavailable-config) → Kubelet 挂载卷 (input) 失败 → 容器启动阻塞 → Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因：Pod 的 YAML 定义中引用了一个不存在的 ConfigMap `unavailable-config` 作为卷 `input`。由于该配置项缺失，kubelet 在执行 `MountVolume.SetUp` 时失败，导致容器无法完成初始化挂载，从而使 Pod 持续处于 `ContainerCreating` 和 `Pending` 状态。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: final
data: {"id": "a1300b7aad954bb1-final", "run_id": "a1300b7aad954bb1", "seq": 2577, "ts_ms": 1788772866353, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz` | ContainerCreating | Pod 定义中引用了不存在的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 作为卷 'input'，导致 kubelet 挂载卷持续失败，Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | `fact-bf96b814dba6` | `Warning FailedMount` ... MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found | 直接指出根因：ConfigMap 缺失导致挂载失败 |\n| 2 | K8s State | `fact-24b2559e994b` | `container.waiting_reason`: reason=\"ContainerCreating\" | 描述 Pod 因等待资源挂载而卡在启动阶段的状态 |\n| 3 | K8s State | `fact-45ae929b7899` | `pod.phase`: Pending | 宏观状态确认 Pod 无法进入运行阶段 |\n| 4 | Metric | `fact-233e939ea5ee` | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (reason=\"ContainerCreating\"): 1 | 验证了 K8s 观测到的 ContainerCreating 等待状态 |\n| 5 | Metric | `fact-dc5c3d5de12a` | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total`: 0 | 确认应用尚未启动，排除应用崩溃重启场景 |\n\n**证据总结**\nKubernetes Event（#1）明确记录了 `unavailable-config` ConfigMap 缺失导致卷挂载失败（`FailedMount`），这直接解释了 Pod 为何因资源无法就绪而处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态（#2, #3, #4），且由于容器从未启动，因此未发生任何重启（#5）。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 定义引用不存在的 ConfigMap (unavailable-config) → Kubelet 挂载卷 (input) 失败 → 容器启动阻塞 → Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因：Pod 的 YAML 定义中引用了一个不存在的 ConfigMap `unavailable-config` 作为卷 `input`。由于该配置项缺失，kubelet 在执行 `MountVolume.SetUp` 时失败，导致容器无法完成初始化挂载，从而使 Pod 持续处于 `ContainerCreating` 和 `Pending` 状态。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 40.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 36.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz: 36.6s (Evidence 32.0s, RCA 4.4s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.6s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 84.13, "metrics": {"run_id": "a1300b7aad954bb1", "mttr": {"value": "1.4m", "seconds": 84.1372766494751, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-volume-mount-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 84137.2766494751, "llm_calls": 12, "llm_duration_ms": 81037.4801158905, "tool_calls": 12, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 12, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 7866.275787353516, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2781.0568809509277}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 40005.98096847534, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 36559.91220474243, "success": true}, "eviden